OL,3,GNEWSASmoking rates rise in Hull,
OL,4,Adespite England fall
OL,5,
OL,6,FSmoking rates in Hull have risen,
OL,7,Fdespite a fall across England.
OL,9,FData from the Annual Population Survey
OL,10,F(APS) showed 19.5% of adults in Hull
OL,11,Fsmoked in 2025. It is the highest rate
OL,12,Fin the country and up from 16.6% in
OL,13,F2023.
OL,15,FHowever, the Department for Health and
OL,16,FSocial Care said the rate across
OL,17,FEngland as a whole had fallen to 9.5%
OL,18,Ffollowing sustained action to help
OL,19,Fpeople quit.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,385,380,200,160,0,100
