OL,3,GNEWSASmoking rates rise in Hull,
OL,4,Adespite England fall
OL,5,
OL,6,FScott Crosby from the Humber and North
OL,7,FYorkshire Centre for Excellence in
OL,8,FTobacco Control said: "There's no point
OL,9,Fhaving a smoke-free country where the
OL,10,Flikes of the South of England are
OL,11,Ftobacco free and Hull isn't. We need
OL,12,Fmore time and we need more investment
OL,13,Fto go in to help people stop smoking."
